.TH RAVEN-TX 1 "September 2025" "Raven Core" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
raven-tx \- Raven Core transaction utility
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B raven-tx
.RI [ options ] " <hex-tx> " [ commands ]
.br
.B raven-tx
.RI [ options ] " -create " [ commands ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B raven-tx
is a low-level utility for inspecting, creating, and modifying raw
transactions. It accepts a transaction hex string or can create a new
transaction with
.BR -create .
.PP
For the complete list of options and commands, run:
.B raven-tx -help
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B -create
Create a new, empty transaction.
.TP
.B -json
Print transactions in JSON format.
.TP
.B -txid
Print the transaction ID.
.SH COMMANDS
Commands are applied in order and include operations such as
.BR "in" ,
.BR "out" ,
.BR "locktime" ,
and
.BR "sign" .
Use
.B raven-tx -help
for the complete list and usage details.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR ravend (1),
.BR raven-cli (1)
